OL,3,GNEWSAGreen Party deputy leader linked
OL,4,Ato property lets despite opposition to
OL,5,Alandlords
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deputy leader of the Green Party,
OL,8,FMothin Ali, is linked to two buy-to-let
OL,9,Fproperties, despite his party's
OL,10,Fopposition to private landlords.
OL,12,FAli is the sole director of a company,
OL,13,Fwhich he set up and controls, that owns
OL,14,Ftwo rental properties in Leeds, bought
OL,15,Fin June 2022 and March 2025 - although
OL,16,Fhe does not appear to profit from
OL,17,Feither of them.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
