OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGreen Party deputy leader linked
OL,4,Ato property lets despite opposition to
OL,5,Alandlords
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe property purchases happened before
OL,8,Fthe Greens adopted a policy committing
OL,9,Fto phasing out ownership of rental
OL,10,Fproperties by private landlords in
OL,11,FOctober 2025.
OL,13,FThe Green Party told the BBC that, at
OL,14,Fthe time Ali had set up the company,
OL,15,Fand since, he "has acted solely in the
OL,16,Finterests of vulnerable close family
OL,17,Fmembers for whom he has caring
OL,18,Fresponsibilities".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
